    "theMoment": "Son Heung-min captains his country at what is likely his final World Cup at age 34. His 2002 World Cup parallel is not lost on Koreans — that squad, led by individual brilliance and collective determination, went further than anyone imagined. Son has spent the last decade carrying South Korean football's hopes. In 2026, this team needs to send him off properly.",
